pan begin="24.657" end="24.797">ま</span><span begin="24.798" end="24.938">っ</span><span begin="24.938" end="25.129">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">目</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="25.129" end="25.337">め</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">覚</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="25.337" end="25.792">ざ</span></span></span><span begin="25.792" end="26.033">ま</span><span begin="26.033" end="26.432">し</span><span begin="26.432" end="26.656">と</span><span begin="26.656" end="27.576">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再响起的闹钟啦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">to ma &apos;t ta me za ma shi to ka</span></p><p begin="27.837" end="30.032" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.837" end="28.046">あ</span><span begin="28.046" end="28.244">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="28.244" end="28.377">ひ</span></span></span><span begin="28.377" end="28.627">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="28.627" end="28.818">て</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">紙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="28.818" end="29.161">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="29.161" end="29.329">み</span></span></span><span begin="29.329" end="29.486">だ</span><span begin="29.486" end="29.649">と</span><span begin="29.649" end="30.032">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那天留下的信笺啦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">a no hi no te ga mi da to ka</span></p><p begin="30.128" end="32.696" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="30.128" end="30.438">きみ</span></span></span><span begin="30.438" end="30.608">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">忘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="30.608" end="30.953">わす</span></span></span><span begin="30.953" end="31.131">れ</span><span begin="31.131" end="31.305">て</span><span begin="31.305" end="31.601">い</span><span begin="31.601" end="31.653">っ</span><span begin="31.653" end="31.773">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">物</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="31.773" end="32.052">もの</span></span></span><span begin="32.052" end="32.268">と</span><span begin="32.268" end="32.696">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不经意遗落的事物啦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ki mi ga wa su re te i &apos;t ta mo no to ka</span></p><p begin="32.982" end="37.706" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">色</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="32.982" end="33.285">いろ</span></span></span><span begin="33.285" end="33.776">を</span><span begin="33.776" end="33.936">な</span><span begin="33.936" end="34.413">く</span><span begin="34.413" end="34.580">し</span><span begin="34.580" end="35.110">て</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">掠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.110" end="35.493">かす</span></span></span><span begin="35.493" end="35.643">れ</span><span begin="35.643" end="35.782">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">記</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.782" end="35.935">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">憶</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.935" end="36.559">おく</span></span></span><span begin="36.559" end="37.067">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">中</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="37.067" end="37.706">なか</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在色彩尽失朦胧斑驳的记忆中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i ro wo na ku shi te ka su re ta ki o ku no na ka</span></p><p begin="37.783" end="40.235" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.783" end="37.933">な</span><span begin="37.933" end="38.076">ぜ</span><span begin="38.076" end="38.239">か</span><span begin="38.239" end="38.414">ふ</span><span begin="38.414" end="38.511">っ</span><span begin="38.511" end="38.619">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">光</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="38.619" end="39.093">ひか</span></span></span><span begin="39.093" end="39.444">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="39.444" end="39.772">だ</span></span></span><span begin="39.772" end="40.235">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何它们会倏然闪耀起光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na ze ka fu &apos;t to hi ka ri da su</span></p><p begin="40.435" end="43.057" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.435" end="40.605">そ</span><span begin="40.605" end="40.762">ん</span><span begin="40.762" end="40.919">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">欠片</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="40.919" end="41.622">かけら</span></span></span><span begin="41.622" end="41.755">ば</span><span begin="41.755" end="42.040">か</span><span begin="42.040" end="42.131">り</span><span begin="42.131" end="42.427">だ</span><span begin="42.427" end="42.536">っ</span><span begin="42.536" end="43.057">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">原来心中留存的都是这样的碎片</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so n na ka ke ra ba ka ri da &apos;t ta</span></p><p begin="43.466" end="46.727" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="43.466" end="43.615">そ</span><span begin="43.615" end="43.783">れ</span><span begin="43.783" end="44.100">ぞ</span><span begin="44.100" end="44.270">れ</span><span begin="44.270" end="44.441">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">道</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="44.441" end="44.737">みち</span></span></span><span begin="44.737" end="44.932">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">歩</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="44.932" end="45.192">ある</span></span></span><span begin="45.192" end="45.411">い</span><span begin="45.411" end="45.606">て</span><span begin="45.606" end="45.770">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="45.770" end="46.062">ぼく</span></span></span><span begin="46.062" end="46.289">た</span><span begin="46.289" end="46.484">ち</span><span begin="46.484" end="46.727">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们都迈步在属于各自的人生轨迹上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so re zo re no mi chi wo a ru i te ru bo ku ta chi ha</span></p><p begin="46.769" end="49.994" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">泣</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="46.769" end="46.933">な</span></span></span><span begin="46.933" end="47.089">け</span><span begin="47.089" end="47.284">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">映</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="47.284" end="47.612">えい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">画</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="47.612" end="47.768">が</span></span></span><span begin="47.768" end="47.962">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">好</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="47.962" end="48.101">す</span></span></span><span begin="48.101" end="48.251">き</span><span begin="48.251" end="48.423">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">曲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="48.423" end="48.757">きょく</span></span></span><span begin="48.757" end="48.854">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">違</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="48.854" end="49.440">ちが</span></span></span><span begin="49.440" end="49.456">っ</span><span begin="49.456" end="49.994">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">惹自己落泪的电影与偏爱的曲子各不相同</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na ke ru e i ga mo su ki na kyo ku mo chi ga &apos;t te</span></p><p begin="50.346" end="53.195" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="50.346" end="50.494">だ</span><span begin="50.494" end="50.790">か</span><span begin="50.790" end="50.960">ら</span><span begin="50.960" end="51.300">こ</span><span begin="51.300" end="51.631">そ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="51.631" end="51.796">で</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">会</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="51.796" end="52.192">あ</span></span></span><span begin="52.192" end="52.345">っ</span><span begin="52.345" end="53.195">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正因如此我们才会遇到彼此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">da ka ra ko so de a &apos;t ta</span></p><p begin="54.274" end="59.453" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">向</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="54.274" end="54.631">む</span></span></span><span begin="54.631" end="54.971">か</span><span begin="54.971" end="55.228">い</span><span begin="55.228" end="55.362">に</span><span begin="55.362" end="55.950">は</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="55.950" end="56.555">なに</span></span></span><span begin="56.555" end="56.854">が</span><span begin="56.854" end="57.084">あ</span><span begin="57.084" end="57.940">る</span><span begin="57.940" end="58.619">だ</span><span begin="58.619" end="59.263">ろ</span><span begin="59.263" end="59.453">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所要面对的未来究竟会发生些什么呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mu ka i ni ha na ni ga a ru da ro u</span></p><p begin="59.873" end="1:02.231" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="59.873" end="1:00.278">きみ</span></span></span><span begin="1:00.278" end="1:00.335">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:00.335" end="1:00.670">いま</span></span></span><span begin="1:00.670" end="1:00.988">ま</span><span begin="1:00.988" end="1:01.273">で</span><span begin="1:01.273" end="1:01.473">の</span><span begin="1:01.473" end="1:01.918">こ</span><span begin="1:01.918" end="1:02.231">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将你迄今为止的过往</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ki mi no i ma ma de no ko to</span></p><p begin="1:02.266" end="1:05.124" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:02.266" end="1:02.492">み</span></span></span><span begin="1:02.492" end="1:02.923">て</span><span begin="1:02.923" end="1:03.100">き</span><span begin="1:03.100" end="1:03.322">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">景</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:03.322" end="1:03.561">け</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">色</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:03.561" end="1:04.175">しき</span></span></span><span begin="1:04.175" end="1:04.571">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">色</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:04.571" end="1:05.124">いろ</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一路见证的万千景色</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mi te ki ta ke shi ki no i ro</span></p><p begin="1:04.907" end="1:08.295" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.907" end="1:05.295">そ</span><span begin="1:05.295" end="1:05.768">れ</span><span begin="1:05.768" end="1:06.267">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">全</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:06.267" end="1:06.765">ぜん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">部</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:06.765" end="1:07.104">ぶ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">教</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:07.104" end="1:07.410">おし</span></span></span><span begin="1:07.410" end="1:07.587">え</span><span begin="1:07.587" end="1:07.773">て</span><span begin="1:07.773" end="1:08.295">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫无保留地告诉我吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so re wo ze n bu o shi e te yo</span></p><p begin="1:08.908" end="1:10.689" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">1</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:08.908" end="1:09.285">ひと</span></span></span><span begin="1:09.285" end="1:09.465">つ</span><span begin="1:09.465" end="1:09.785">だ</span><span begin="1:09.785" end="1:09.886">っ</span><span begin="1:09.886" end="1:10.041">て</span><span begin="1:10.041" end="1:10.279">な</span><span begin="1:10.279" end="1:10.445">い</span><span begin="1:10.445" end="1:10.689">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经所经历的过往</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hi to tsu da &apos;t te na i yo</span></p><p begin="1:10.713" end="1:12.678" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:10.713" end="1:10.900">む</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">駄</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:10.900" end="1:11.113">だ</span></span></span><span begin="1:11.113" end="1:11.287">な</span><span begin="1:11.287" end="1:11.412">も</span><span begin="1:11.412" end="1:11.781">の</span><span begin="1:11.781" end="1:12.030">な</span><span begin="1:12.030" end="1:12.112">ん</span><span begin="1:12.112" end="1:12.678">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝没有一段是徒劳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mu da na mo no na n te</span></p><p begin="1:12.938" end="1:15.462" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">意</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:12.938" end="1:13.092">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">味</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.092" end="1:13.283">み</span></span></span><span begin="1:13.283" end="1:13.434">の</span><span begin="1:13.434" end="1:13.623">な</span><span begin="1:13.623" end="1:13.786">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">涙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.786" end="1:14.344">なみだ</span></span></span><span begin="1:14.344" end="1:14.669">な</span><span begin="1:14.669" end="1:14.855">ん</span><span begin="1:14.855" end="1:15.462">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有的泪水都有意义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i mi no na i na mi da na n te</span></p><p begin="1:15.637" end="1:19.229" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:15.637" end="1:16.287">ぼく</span></span></span><span begin="1:16.287" end="1:16.455">の</span><span begin="1:16.455" end="1:16.922">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">比</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:16.922" end="1:17.562">くら</span></span></span><span begin="1:17.562" end="1:17.800">べ</span><span begin="1:17.800" end="1:18.236">な</span><span begin="1:18.236" end="1:18.511">が</span><span begin="1:18.511" end="1:19.229">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将与我的经历彼此对照</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">bo ku no to ku ra be na ga ra</span></p><p begin="1:19.578" end="1:24.107" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.578" end="1:19.810">ね</span><span begin="1:19.810" end="1:19.978">ぇ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">一</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:19.978" end="1:20.161">いっ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">緒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:20.161" end="1:20.481">しょ</span></span></span><span begin="1:20.481" end="1:20.954">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">歌</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:20.954" end="1:21.378">うた</span></span></span><span begin="1:21.378" end="1:21.426">っ</span><span begin="1:21.426" end="1:21.621">て</span><span begin="1:21.621" end="1:24.107">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 一起放声歌唱起来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ne i &apos;s sho ni u ta &apos;t te yo</span></p><p begin="1:32.840" end="1:37.727" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">鍵</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:32.840" end="1:33.306">かぎ</span></span></span><span begin="1:33.306" end="1:33.794">を</span><span begin="1:33.794" end="1:33.989">な</span><span begin="1:33.989" end="1:34.463">く</span><span begin="1:34.463" end="1:34.619">し</span><span begin="1:34.619" end="1:35.138">て</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">開</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:35.138" end="1:35.299">あ</span></span></span><span begin="1:35.299" end="1:35.452">け</span><span begin="1:35.452" end="1:35.643">ら</span><span begin="1:35.643" end="1:35.797">れ</span><span begin="1:35.797" end="1:35.971">な</span><span begin="1:35.971" end="1:36.424">か</span><span begin="1:36.424" end="1:36.474">っ</span><span begin="1:36.474" end="1:36.567">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">扉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:36.567" end="1:37.727">とびら</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将钥匙弄丢之后便无法再开启那扇门扉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ka gi wo na ku shi te a ke ra re na ka &apos;t ta to bi ra</span></p><p begin="1:37.669" end="1:40.247" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:37.669" end="1:37.861">な</span><span begin="1:37.861" end="1:38.098">ぜ</span><span begin="1:38.098" end="1:38.265">か</span><span begin="1:38.265" end="1:38.605">ふ</span><span begin="1:38.605" end="1:38.668">っ</span><span begin="1:38.668" end="1:38.922">と</span><span begin="1:38.922" end="1:39.113">わ</span><span begin="1:39.113" end="1:39.332">か</span><span begin="1:39.332" end="1:39.455">っ</span><span begin="1:39.455" end="1:39.719">た</span><span begin="1:39.719" end="1:39.827">ん</span><span begin="1:39.827" end="1:40.247">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知为何 我突然就醒悟过来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na ze ka fu &apos;t to wa ka &apos;t ta n da</span></p><p begin="1:40.445" end="1:43.382" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">鍵</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:40.445" end="1:40.793">かぎ</span></span></span><span begin="1:40.793" end="1:40.954">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">1</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:40.954" end="1:41.256">ひと</span></span></span><span begin="1:41.256" end="1:41.268">つ</span><span begin="1:41.268" end="1:41.616">じ</span><span begin="1:41.616" end="1:41.839">ゃ</span><span begin="1:41.839" end="1:41.917">な</span><span begin="1:41.917" end="1:42.077">い</span><span begin="1:42.077" end="1:42.323">こ</span><span begin="1:42.323" end="1:43.382">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实钥匙并非只有一把</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ka gi ha hi to tsu ja na i ko to</span></p><p begin="1:43.451" end="1:45.139" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.451" end="1:43.639">そ</span><span begin="1:43.639" end="1:43.799">れ</span><span begin="1:43.799" end="1:44.134">ぞ</span><span begin="1:44.134" end="1:44.290">れ</span><span begin="1:44.290" end="1:44.437">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">記</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:44.437" end="1:44.611">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">号</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:44.611" end="1:44.942">ごう</span></span></span><span begin="1:44.942" end="1:45.139">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们各自都在创造着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so re zo re no ki go u wo</span></p><p begin="1:45.139" end="1:46.754" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:45.139" end="1:45.184">う</span></span></span><span begin="1:45.184" end="1:45.424">み</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:45.424" end="1:45.681">だ</span></span></span><span begin="1:45.681" end="1:45.808">す</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:45.808" end="1:46.152">ぼく</span></span></span><span begin="1:46.152" end="1:46.256">た</span><span begin="1:46.256" end="1:46.469">ち</span><span begin="1:46.469" end="1:46.754">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">独属自己的那个记号</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">u mi da su bo ku ta chi ha</span></p><p begin="1:46.856" end="1:50.159" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:46.856" end="1:47.184">おも</span></span></span><span begin="1:47.184" end="1:47.375">い</span><span begin="1:47.375" end="1:47.551">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">強</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:47.551" end="1:47.872">つよ</span></span></span><span begin="1:47.872" end="1:48.039">さ</span><span begin="1:48.039" end="1:48.168">も</span><span begin="1:48.168" end="1:48.375">あ</span><span begin="1:48.375" end="1:48.464">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">方</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:48.464" end="1:48.848">かた</span></span></span><span begin="1:48.848" end="1:49.038">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">違</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:49.038" end="1:49.371">ちが</span></span></span><span begin="1:49.371" end="1:49.519">っ</span><span begin="1:49.519" end="1:50.159">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">执念的深浅与存在的方式各不相同</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">o mo i no tsu yo sa mo a ri ka ta mo chi ga &apos;t te</span></p><p begin="1:50.394" end="1:53.105" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.394" end="1:50.578">だ</span><span begin="1:50.578" end="1:50.907">か</span><span begin="1:50.907" end="1:51.092">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">認</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:51.092" end="1:51.737">みと</span></span></span><span begin="1:51.737" end="1:52.074">め</span><span begin="1:52.074" end="1:52.229">あ</span><span begin="1:52.229" end="1:52.384">っ</span><span begin="1:52.385" end="1:53.105">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正因如此我们才能相互认同</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">da ka ra mi to me a &apos;t ta</span></p><p begin="1:54.384" end="1:59.457" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">互</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:54.384" end="1:55.064">たが</span></span></span><span begin="1:55.064" end="1:55.335">い</span><span begin="1:55.335" end="1:55.800">に</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">語</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:55.800" end="1:56.702">かた</span></span></span><span begin="1:56.702" end="1:57.126">り</span><span begin="1:57.126" end="1:57.358">あ</span><span begin="1:57.358" end="1:57.870">え</span><span begin="1:57.870" end="1:58.087">る</span><span begin="1:58.087" end="1:58.663">だ</span><span begin="1:58.663" end="1:59.175">ろ</span><span begin="1:59.175" end="1:59.457">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想必也可以把心声倾诉给对方吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ta ga i ni ka ta ri a e ru da ro u</span></p><p begin="1:59.863" end="2:05.034" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:59.863" end="2:00.318">きみ</span></span></span><span begin="2:00.318" end="2:00.503">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:00.503" end="2:00.860">いま</span></span></span><span begin="2:00.860" end="2:01.084">ま</span><span begin="2:01.084" end="2:01.428">で</span><span begin="2:01.428" end="2:01.613">の</span><span begin="2:01.613" end="2:01.949">こ</span><span begin="2:01.949" end="2:02.342">と</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">隠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:02.342" end="2:03.092">かく</span></span></span><span begin="2:03.092" end="2:03.292">し</span><span begin="2:03.292" end="2:03.573">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:03.573" end="2:03.966">こと</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">葉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:03.966" end="2:04.189">ば</span></span></span><span begin="2:04.189" end="2:04.444">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">数</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:04.444" end="2:05.034">かず</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将你迄今为止的过往 藏匿于心底的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ki mi no i ma ma de no ko to ka ku shi ta ko to ba no ka zu</span></p><p begin="2:05.034" end="2:08.575" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:05.034" end="2:05.394">そ</span><span begin="2:05.394" end="2:05.794">れ</span><span begin="2:05.794" end="2:06.290">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">全</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.290" end="2:06.778">ぜん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">部</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.778" end="2:07.100">ぶ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">教</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:07.100" end="2:07.407">おし</span></span></span><span begin="2:07.407" end="2:07.592">え</span><span begin="2:07.592" end="2:07.771">て</span><span begin="2:07.771" end="2:08.575">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫无保留地告诉我吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so re wo ze n bu o shi e te yo</span></p><p begin="2:08.987" end="2:10.688" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:08.987" end="2:09.127">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:09.127" end="2:09.293">い</span><span begin="2:09.293" end="2:09.456">た</span><span begin="2:09.456" end="2:09.781">く</span><span begin="2:09.781" end="2:10.123">は</span><span begin="2:10.123" end="2:10.238">な</span><span begin="2:10.238" end="2:10.385">い</span><span begin="2:10.385" end="2:10.688">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实我并不想说</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i i ta ku ha na i yo</span></p><p begin="2:10.704" end="2:12.830" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:10.704" end="2:10.704">「</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">知</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:10.704" end="2:10.937">し</span></span></span><span begin="2:10.937" end="2:11.108">ら</span><span begin="2:11.108" end="2:11.279">な</span><span begin="2:11.279" end="2:11.620">か</span><span begin="2:11.620" end="2:11.680">っ</span><span begin="2:11.680" end="2:11.802">た</span><span begin="2:11.802" end="2:11.802">」</span><span begin="2:11.802" end="2:12.087">な</span><span begin="2:12.087" end="2:12.230">ん</span><span begin="2:12.230" end="2:12.830">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“我根本不知道”之类的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">「 shi ra na ka &apos;t ta 」 na n te</span></p><p begin="2:12.869" end="2:15.497" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:12.869" end="2:12.869">「</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">関</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:12.869" end="2:13.265">かん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">係</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:13.265" end="2:13.608">けい</span></span></span><span begin="2:13.608" end="2:13.765">な</span><span begin="2:13.765" end="2:13.926">い</span><span begin="2:13.926" end="2:14.072">か</span><span begin="2:14.072" end="2:14.440">ら</span><span begin="2:14.440" end="2:14.440">」</span><span begin="2:14.440" end="2:14.649">な</span><span begin="2:14.649" end="2:14.872">ん</span><span begin="2:14.872" end="2:15.497">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“跟我没有关系”之类的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">「 ka n ke i na i ka ra 」 na n te</span></p><p begin="2:15.579" end="2:21.772" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.579" end="2:16.297">ぼく</span></span></span><span begin="2:16.297" end="2:16.464">の</span><span begin="2:16.464" end="2:16.948">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">並</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.948" end="2:17.624">なら</span></span></span><span begin="2:17.624" end="2:17.784">べ</span><span begin="2:17.784" end="2:18.251">な</span><span begin="2:18.251" end="2:18.460">が</span><span begin="2:18.460" end="2:19.264">ら</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">一</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.692" end="2:19.859">いっ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">緒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.859" end="2:20.075">しょ</span></span></span><span begin="2:20.075" end="2:20.286">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">悩</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:20.286" end="2:20.675">なや</span></span></span><span begin="2:20.675" end="2:20.892">ん</span><span begin="2:20.893" end="2:21.205">で</span><span begin="2:21.205" end="2:21.772">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将与我的烦恼相互排列 一起去思索烦恼吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">bo ku no to na ra be na ga ra i &apos;s sho ni na ya n de yo</span></p><p begin="2:21.918" end="2:27.292" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">違</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:21.918" end="2:22.319">ちが</span></span></span><span begin="2:22.319" end="2:22.544">う</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">足</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.544" end="2:23.129">あし</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">音</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:23.129" end="2:23.767">おと</span></span></span><span begin="2:23.767" end="2:24.332">を</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">鳴</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.586" end="2:24.788">な</span></span></span><span begin="2:24.788" end="2:24.955">ら</span><span begin="2:24.955" end="2:25.126">し</span><span begin="2:25.126" end="2:25.621">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">誰</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:25.621" end="2:26.282">だれ</span></span></span><span begin="2:26.282" end="2:26.512">か</span><span begin="2:26.512" end="2:27.292">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">致那些踏出不同脚步声的人们</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">chi ga u a shi o to wo na ra shi ta da re ka ni</span></p><p begin="2:27.638" end="2:29.964" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:27.638" end="2:27.809">み</span></span></span><span begin="2:27.809" end="2:28.267">え</span><span begin="2:28.267" end="2:28.383">て</span><span begin="2:28.383" end="2:28.530">い</span><span begin="2:28.530" end="2:28.867">な</span><span begin="2:28.867" end="2:28.995">く</span><span begin="2:28.995" end="2:29.208">て</span><span begin="2:29.208" end="2:29.964">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕根本无法得见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mi e te i na ku te mo</span></p><p begin="2:30.218" end="2:32.388" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">聞</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:30.218" end="2:30.382">き</span></span></span><span begin="2:30.382" end="2:30.640">こ</span><span begin="2:30.640" end="2:30.912">え</span><span begin="2:30.912" end="2:31.059">て</span><span begin="2:31.059" end="2:31.112">い</span><span begin="2:31.112" end="2:31.419">な</span><span begin="2:31.419" end="2:31.437">く</span><span begin="2:31.437" end="2:31.817">て</span><span begin="2:31.817" end="2:32.388">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕从来都不曾听到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ki ko e te i na ku te mo</span></p><p begin="2:32.592" end="2:36.763" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.592" end="2:32.787">こ</span><span begin="2:32.787" end="2:32.940">こ</span><span begin="2:32.940" end="2:33.350">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">残</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:33.576" end="2:34.283">のこ</span></span></span><span begin="2:34.283" end="2:34.603">し</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">続</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:34.603" end="2:35.087">つづ</span></span></span><span begin="2:35.087" end="2:35.449">け</span><span begin="2:35.449" end="2:35.636">よ</span><span begin="2:35.636" end="2:36.763">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍要将痕迹留在这里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ko ko ni no ko shi tsu zu ke yo u</span></p><p begin="2:36.938" end="2:41.582" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">気</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:36.938" end="2:37.080">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">付</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:37.080" end="2:37.278">づ</span></span></span><span begin="2:37.278" end="2:37.681">き</span><span begin="2:37.681" end="2:38.283">あ</span><span begin="2:38.283" end="2:38.757">え</span><span begin="2:38.889" end="2:38.940">る</span><span begin="2:38.940" end="2:39.287">よ</span><span begin="2:39.287" end="2:39.825">う</span><span begin="2:39.825" end="2:41.582">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为能让彼此察觉到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ki zu ki a e ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="2:42.415" end="2:44.999" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v2"><spa