er"><span tts:ruby="base">全</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:48.928" end="2:49.461">ぜん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">部</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:49.461" end="2:49.741">ぶ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">教</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:49.741" end="2:50.100">おし</span></span></span><span begin="2:50.100" end="2:50.304">え</span><span begin="2:50.304" end="2:50.488">る</span><span begin="2:50.488" end="2:51.530">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫无保留地都告诉你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so re wo ze n bu o shi e ru yo</span></p><p begin="2:51.601" end="2:55.367" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">1</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:51.601" end="2:51.943">ひと</span></span></span><span begin="2:51.943" end="2:52.147">つ</span><span begin="2:52.147" end="2:52.333">だ</span><span begin="2:52.333" end="2:52.383">っ</span><span begin="2:52.383" end="2:52.770">て</span><span begin="2:52.770" end="2:52.940">な</span><span begin="2:52.940" end="2:53.135">い</span><span begin="2:53.135" end="2:53.310">よ</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">楽</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:53.371" end="2:53.785">らく</span></span></span><span begin="2:53.785" end="2:53.952">な</span><span begin="2:53.952" end="2:54.126">も</span><span begin="2:54.126" end="2:54.471">の</span><span begin="2:54.471" end="2:54.700">な</span><span begin="2:54.700" end="2:54.818">ん</span><span begin="2:54.818" end="2:55.367">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经所经历的过往 从来都不轻松安逸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hi to tsu da &apos;t te na i yo ra ku na mo no na n te</span></p><p begin="2:55.610" end="2:58.053" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span